{"id":"00060","root":"uni00060_1","name":{"ja":"弓走　颯","en":"Yubashiri Hayate"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"弓走　颯","en":"Yubashiri Hayate"},"element":"Natural","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-10-19","limited":false,"characterId":53,"profile":{"ja":"里に昔からある弓の名門弓走家の長女。幼いころから跡取りとして弓の訓練を受けているため、弓術においては達人レベルの腕を持っている。目視できる距離でならほぼ１００％の確率で標的に矢を当てることができ、自身の忍術・風遁の力を使い、矢に風を纏わせることにより殺傷能力を上昇させたり、弓の軌道をある程度操ることができる。幼いころから厳しく育てられていたため、少し融通の利かないところがある。また、冗談を冗談と取れずにちょっとしたことで苛立ってしまう時があり、そのことをどうにかしたいと精神鍛錬を行うなど、耐性をつけようと日々精進している。","en":"Yubashiri Hayate is the eldest daughter of the prestigious Yumi Hashi archery family that has existed in the village for generations. Trained as the heir from childhood, she possesses master-level skill with the bow. She can hit a target at visual range with nearly 100 % accuracy, and by using her ninja wind-style ninjutsu she can cloak her arrows in wind to increase their lethality and even manipulate the bow's trajectory to some extent. Because she was raised strictly, she can be a bit inflexible, and she sometimes gets irritated by minor things when she fails to recognize a joke as such. Determined to improve, she practices mental discipline daily to build greater tolerance."},"illustrator":"ＺＯＬ","voiceActor":"御苑生メイ","forms":[{"id":"uni00060_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[964,1928],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[142,284],"def":[112,224],"spd":[65,65],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","30007"]},{"id":"uni00060_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1428,2856],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[219,438],"def":[159,318],"spd":[65,65],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","30007","30008"]},{"id":"uni00060_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1892,3785],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[301,601],"def":[211,421],"spd":[65,65],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","30007","30008"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":1,"cuti